      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Those feelings of hopelessness are common in deep pain, but imagining a life without your sister does not mean your love is unselfish—it means you are incapable of accepting the loss. There is no logical solution where staying away from a loved one resolves the suffering it causes for them, as your connection remains the only anchor between you both. Please reach out to a crisis line or therapist immediately, because even if change feels impossible now, it does not mean it cannot begin with just a single conversation.",
